# Wingnut, Bat on the Belfry: "Alliance — Whenever another creature you control enters, Wingnut gains your choice of flying,
# menace, or haste until end of turn." Turn 1: Wingnut for {1}{R} (his own entering is not "another": no keywords), then three
# Ornithopters, choosing flying, menace and haste in turn, each keyword in addition to the last. Choosing haste lets the
# summoning-sick Wingnut attack at once (Bot2 19). At the next turn the keywords are gone, and neither Bot2's Ornithopter
# entering on turn 2 ("you control") nor Bot1's own Mox Ruby on turn 3 (not a creature) gives him one.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby x2
Wingnut, Bat on the Belfry
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Mox Ruby
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

